    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27591" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">măgĭcē</span></b> ,
			ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαγική</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>),
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the magic art,
				magic, sorcery</i> (post-Aug.): pariter utrasque artes
			effloruisse, medicinam
			 dico magicenque, <i><span class="en">Plin. 30, 1,
				2, § 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">30, 1, 2, § 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">magices factio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					30, 1, 2, § 11</span></i>
			.</div>
